      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        120.19074249267578,
        524.408935546875,
        134.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "with levofloxacin/moxifloxacin, clofazimine, ethambutol and pyrazinamide. The eligibility criteria are:",
