      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        229.59864807128906,
        527.4276123046875,
        244.04164123535156
      ],
      "text": "Extensive (or advanced) TB disease refers to the presence of bilateral cavitary disease or extensive",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
