      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        255.9987335205078,
        527.5817260742188,
        270.4417419433594
      ],
      "text": "defined by the presence of cavities or bilateral disease on CXR. Severe EPTB refers to the presence of",
