      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        266.40460205078125,
        527.3927612304688,
        283.6416320800781
      ],
      "text": "(61) miliary TB or TBM (i.e. disseminated disease)  . In children aged under 15 years, extrapulmonary",
