      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.976123809814453,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        292.80462646484375,
        527.2764892578125,
        310.0416564941406
      ],
      "text": "(86) compression) are considered as severe  . The shorter regimen should not be used in the presence",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.995048522949219,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        308.798583984375,
        527.4334106445312,
        323.2416076660156
      ],
      "text": "of mutations in both the inhA promoter and katG on first-line LPA (MTBDRplus) in the child as this",
