      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        319.20458984375,
        432.00048828125,
        336.4416198730469
      ],
      "text": "(87) suggests that both isoniazid at high dose and thioamides are not effective  .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        343.7025146484375,
        527.5761108398438,
        358.1455383300781
      ],
      "text": "Promoting the use of bedaquiline in all-oral regimens for children will allow the construction of",
