      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        370.10260009765625,
        527.1054077148438,
        384.5456237792969
      ],
      "text": "drugs with potentially more severe adverse events compared to bedaquiline (including, but not limited",
